        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Guk kam Kuɔth kɛnɛ Nowa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ, cu Kuoth Nowa kɛnɛ gaatkɛ cu poth, kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Diëthɛ rɔ̱ a bia wi̱c muɔ̱ɔ̱n thiäŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ le̱y diaal bikɛ cieŋ dualkɛ kɛ yɛ, diit nhial kɛ le̱y amäni rɛc yiëri, bi yɛn kɛ ruac kɛn diaal ɛwic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn diaal tin tëk wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n bikɛ a mi̱thkun. Ni kɛ tho̱p ëë cä thöp ni yɛ wal diaal tin tɔ̱ɔ̱c, ɣän bä, cä yɛ ka̱m ti̱ti̱ diaal ala mi̱thkun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku duundɛ la ɣöö /cia ri̱ŋ mi te riɛmdɛ thi̱n bi cam, kɛ ɣöö riɛmdɛ ɛ jɛn tëkdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛpuc, ɣän bä riɛm ran thiec puɔ̱ɔ̱ny raam mi wä jɛ bath, mi ɛ le̱y kiɛ ɛ raan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ram mi wä riɛm ran wä wuɔ̱th piny, ba riɛmdɛ wuɔ̱th piny ɛ raan bä, kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth raan cak nikɛ cätdä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä yɛn, diëthɛ rɔ̱ a wee wä, kä a kuaykun thia̱ŋkɛ wi̱c muɔ̱ɔ̱n.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔrɛ, cuɛ Nowa kɛnɛ gaatkɛ ku jiök i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nɛ̈nɛ jɛ, ɣän bä gukdä la̱th piny kɛ yɛ kɛɛl täämɛ amäni kuaykun tin ba yɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amäni le̱y diaal tin tekɛ yɛ kɛɛl, diit kɛ ɣɔ̱k, nikɛ pe̱k kä tin ci ben raar rɛy ria̱a̱y. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän la̱thä gukdä piny kɛ yɛ, ɛn ɣöö thilɛ yiey ti ba nyɔk kɛ näk ɛ nyɔc, kä thilɛ nyɔc dɔ̱diɛn mi bi wi̱c muɔ̱ɔ̱n nyɔk kɛ däk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nyuuth matdä ruacdä min cä la̱th piny kamädä kɛ yɛ amäni le̱y diaal tin tekɛ yɛ kɛɛl kɛ ri̱c tɔ̱ bëë tɔ̱, jɛn ɛn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ɣän bä mi̱i̱tdä la̱th puɔ̱rä, kä bɛ la nyuuth matdä ruac kamädä kɔnɛ ɣɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ gua̱a̱th mi wa̱a̱ nhiaal jak kä wun, kä jɔc mi̱i̱t puɔ̱rä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ɛn guäth ɔ, ɣän bä gukdä ëë cä la̱th piny kamädä kɛ yɛ kɛnɛ le̱y diaal tim. Kä /ci pi̱ nhial rɔ̱ bi nyɔk ala nyɔc mi bi nɛy diaal nyɔk kɛ däk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ gua̱a̱th ɔ bi tekɛ mi̱i̱t nhial rɛy pua̱a̱ri mɔ, ɣän bä jɛ nɛn, ɛn guäth ɔ bä guk mi thil pe̱k kamädä ɣän Kuɔth kɛnɛ ŋɔak diaal tin tëk wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n cu tim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mɛmɛ ɛ jɛn nyuuth gukädä min cä la̱th piny kamädä kɛnɛ ŋɔak diaal tin cieŋ wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nowa kɛnɛ Gaatkɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ, kɛn gaat Nowa tëë bä raar rɛy ria̱a̱y ɛ Cɛm kɛnɛ Ɣɛ̈m kɛ Ya-pɛth. Kä Ɣɛ̈m ɛ gua̱n Kɛ-naan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti̱ti̱ kɛ kɛn gaat Nowa da̱ŋ diɔ̱k, kä kɛ kɛn diëëth nɛɛni diaal wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä jɛn Nowa ɛ pi̱i̱th, ɛ jɛn ram kɛl ëë took pi̱eth kakä wal kɛ kui̱ kɔaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cɛ maath kɛ kɔŋ, cuɛ yɔ̱ŋ, kä cuɛ tɔ̱ɔ̱c juutdä rɛy duëëlɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci gua̱n Kɛ-naan ni Ɣɛ̈m ta̱a̱ juutdä gua̱n nɛn, cuɛ jɛ la̱t dämani raar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn guäth ɔ cu Cɛm kɛnɛ Ya-pɛth bi̱i̱ ka̱n, kä cukɛ jɛ kuɛr wuɔ̱ɔ̱knikiɛn kä cukɛ ben kɛ jɔak jɔak, kä cukɛ jɛ kum a cikɛ wuɔ̱thkiɛn riet jɔ̱ɔ̱r, kä /ke̱nkɛ ta̱a̱ juutdä gua̱ndiɛn nɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci kɔaŋ wecdɛ wä piny cuɛ min ci gatdɛ min tɔt ɛ lät kä jɛ ŋa̱c, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cuɛ wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr nyɔac cu Nowa te te̱e̱kä kɛ run ti kur diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ jiɛn dhieec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn, täämɛ mat runi te̱e̱kä Nowa diaal kɛ run ti kur bäŋuan wi̱cdɛ jiɛn dhieec, cuɛ cu li̱w.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
